## 🛡️ Avengers: Assemble the Blocks

Welcome to your Voiden guide for reusing blocks from other files—because heroes don’t work alone, and neither should your API.

In Voiden, every block is its own little superhero: endpoints, headers, query params, even request bodies. And when you bring them together?
You don’t just write code—you **assemble** greatness.

---

> Imported blocks are read-only in the files that they have been imported into, if you need to edit them you must go the source files by clicking on the "**Go to source**" . If you want to copy it within this document, you can do that by clicking "**unlink**" and then it becomes detached from the source document.

